# The speaker layout on the kit, which carries every layout: Change opens the sheet, a quick pick is taken at Apply while
# nothing plays, and the other way in (how many around you, how many heights, how they are mounted) builds the same
# names. The worst case, nine around you with six up-firing heights, is on the glass with every control reachable.
board p4-rev3-kit
display 1024 600
scene lyrics

tap "Preferences"
expect shown "Speaker layout"
expect pref speaker-layout = 2.0

tap "Change" in "Speaker layout"
expect shown "Quick picks"
tap "7.1.4"
expect text "seven around you, one subwoofer, four heights"
tap "Apply"
expect pref speaker-layout = 7.1.4
expect text "Seven around you"

tap "Change" in "Speaker layout"
tap "Build yours"
tap "9"
tap "6"
tap "Up-firing"
expect text "9.1.6:upfiring"
shot layout-9-1-6-upfiring
tap "Apply"
expect pref speaker-layout = 9.1.6:upfiring

tap "Change" in "Speaker layout"
tap "2.0"
tap "Apply"
expect pref speaker-layout = 2.0

tap "Close"
